  "has_quantitative_results": true,
  "summary": "The paper proposes a QAOA variant with a Quantum Walk Mixer (QWM‑QAOA) for knapsack‑based portfolio optimization and evaluates it on portfolios of 2–8 stocks. Using p=3 circuit layers and m=3 Trotter steps, the algorithm achieves approximation ratios of 1.00–0.96 on a simulator and 0.96–0.51 on real IBM Nazca hardware (up to 15 qubits). No computational speedup over classical optimization is demonstrated.",
